{
  "slug": "voicenter",
  "name": "Voicenter",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Manage Voicenter Cloud contact center real time communication with your own app or CRM using claude code and voicenter skills and mcp plugin. control calls, get real time webhooks, active auodialer campiagns, reports, users and Queues, and much more.",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install voicenter@claude-community` from `VoicenterTeam/claude-marketplace`.\n\nOfficial Claude Code plugins for integrating the Voicenter telephony platform into your application or CRM.\n\nManage Voicenter Cloud contact center real time communication with your own app or CRM using claude code and voicenter skills and mcp plugin. control calls, get real time webhooks, active auodialer campiagns, reports, users and Queues, and much more.",
